    #piks

    Nesting: //₩
        >we have title and node nesting
        >nodes bits of information
        >titles are for structuring and can appear in the table of contents
        >nesting can be relative or absolute
        >C label style titles are relatively nested
        >C define style titles are absolutely nested
        >absolute nesting is determined by the number of ':'s
        >relative nesting is determined by adding up the indentation
          and the previous absolute nesting
        >relatively nested titles are easy to move and reorganize, only a cut is needed

    Colors: //₩
        >Green(CDD supports some color tags)
        >Red(this only has significance for renderers)

    Code:
        @begin=<language>@
        @end=<language>@
        {@begin=python@
            def fun(): pass
        @end=python@}

